54906667433932_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O5uNv3xf-IwQ7kNvwEN81Af&_nc_oc=AdoscBPlR_H0x8fnocYLPKhOS5JuW_5YPa2P0QYl9-huKbQH128awCht6-V1FdaBYrw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9PZ1xAaNJqL9TsG4R_HpKATMqD8cRZp7vNbNj8GlShCg&oe=6A47B292"}, "display_name": "Spatial Phone : Mirror & Control", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# **UPDATE: You can control your iPhone \ud83d\udcf1 in VR using the Spatial Phone app!**\n\nFinally figured out a way to control your iPhone in VR on your Meta Quest \u2014  something that was previously only possible on Android.\n {713821661542598}\n\nYou can mirror and control your iPhone/Android phone directly onto your Meta Quest with high-quality passthrough and low latency. Use it in any app or game.\n\nNote : iPhone needs to be paired with your Meta Quest each time you want to use the control feature. This is a limitation of the current technology and may be resolved in the future.\n\n# Features:\n\n**\ud83d\udd39 High-Resolution Passthrough**\n{1416266739395027}\nEnjoy crystal-clear visuals of your Android/iOS device inside your Meta Quest headset with very low latency and stereo audio (40ms-90ms)\n\n**\ud83d\udd39 Can be used with other apps/games**\n{1485561639489864}\n This app can be used in background with other app/games\n\n**\ud83d\udd39 Control with Meta Quest Controllers**\n{1469651341149898}\n\n**\ud83d\udd39 Easy to connect and private peer-to-peer connection**\n{705784252315372}\nConnect on the same network or internet without any custom setting. Your data stays private with end-to-end peer-to-peer connections. No additional data is collected or stored.\n\n\n\nFor additional help you can reach out on discord :  https://discord.gg/99qgmSxUZ9\n\n\n{1367013974588349}\nRequirements : iPhone or Android 8+ are currently supported.\n\nThe companion software is free to download.", "short_description": "You can mirror and control your iPhone or Android phone directly in your Meta Quest. Which offers high quality passthrough, stereo sound quality.\nIt's easy to connect too.\n\nRequirements : iPhone or Android 8+ is supported\n\nYou can use this to read pdf, watch videos, reply to text, music and control your device without leaving the Meta Quest headset.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/4f218ce8-3057-4610-8545-49362731f8ab", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "butter chicken pizza", "support_website_url": "https://tinyurl.com/zp2s2m4f", "website_url": "https://spatial-phone-mirror-control-9ab924.webflow.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "1055187466124150"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "23941628885431930"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982585_4246937355526471_4703471268929711558_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YNfzmnwhc_AQ7kNvwHkc1Jd&_nc_oc=Adq-NOuFjwwyNS6Pc58mGOP-vHgHIshl7Gf2P6PQ0XZ97-nfkZyi1yUTJBMTZQMuBuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-sRsOwZ4Pn0Tsq82ckNQSHkE6GCl59avABBM2VteF0FQ&oe=6A47B42F"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Spatial Phone : Mirror & Control", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "cont